      "applicability": "low",
      "direction": "neutral_or_unclear",
      "decision_effect": "no_change",
      "card_ids": ["C53", "C54", "C56", "C57", "C58"]
    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No query-specific absolute oral bioavailability or matched oral-versus-IV exposure data are available.",
    "No query-specific permeability, solubility, efflux, or intestinal-metabolism measurements exist; L5 records are for verapamil and other reference molecules, not the query.",
    "No cirrhosis-specific pharmacokinetic data exist for the query or a close structural analog; the only cirrhosis-matched F record is meptazinol, a different scaffold.",
    "L5 verapamil efflux evidence is conflicting across assays (elacridar no change in rat AUC/Cmax versus P-gp inhibition increasing permeability in situ) and is not threshold-specific.",
